A. Commit message:
firmware: imx: Add ARCH_MXC dependency for IMX_SCMI_MISC_DRV

B. Change summary:
Added a dependency on ARCH_MXC for the IMX_SCMI_MISC_DRV configuration option to ensure it is only enabled when building for Freescale i.MX SoCs. This prevents unnecessary prompts during kernel configuration for unsupported platforms.

C. Compatibility Risk:
Low

D. Fixed Code:
diff --git a/drivers/firmware/imx/Kconfig b/drivers/firmware/imx/Kconfig
index 907cd149c40a8..c964f4924359f 100644
--- a/drivers/firmware/imx/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/firmware/imx/Kconfig
@@ -25,6 +25,7 @@ config IMX_SCU
 
 config IMX_SCMI_MISC_DRV
 	tristate "IMX SCMI MISC Protocol driver"
+	depends on ARCH_MXC || COMPILE_TEST
 	default y if ARCH_MXC
 	help
 	  The System Controller Management Interface firmware (SCMI FW) is